vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GZAnhKnPpCUQ7kNvwGt7CHR&_nc_oc=AdmioIdqCll35HJJM76lwdqlQ_MOq_zxKaxW-cUHyF14zIBBGoidfAteaso8cMQuOBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzY9Z9M-gtjZig7E4rWz70M7Nau4JRjA__zmjdxXoozxw&oe=69B55CD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aoRWBZkJJVIQ7kNvwEEJjXI&_nc_oc=AdkQMHIJIPHQkCO9ncL-aEpo9MhDoXJ2m70gDGUMF21L8fpsDxrH57SnxVQ_aO52HT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfycmLZ-s5uu0Cpu1RuD-6IM2gXSxUYO7Zg-CKVAUNbGTg&oe=69B561B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TCSeBSB3KOgQ7kNvwFV1QRr&_nc_oc=AdmAftLuo5Y-Y15nr-Wtj0lvdj-U0IzwymKSk3ReUA1dhQvBWRGF3wiRD9vXlEljWQM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy77mI71y8Cf_yJ2f2LgK8AJE6-lm2bVEbMLA29OmGPFg&oe=69B56F55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "